WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.015
What can StarSI do for your school?

00:00:03.165 --> 00:00:09.140
It brings enrollment, tuition and everyday
office work together so you can spend more
time teaching.

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:11.800
How can I enroll more students?

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:17.245
Follow up with interested families and
give them an online agreement when they’re
ready to enroll.

00:00:17.395 --> 00:00:20.850
How does StarSI help with tuition and
office work?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.960
Families can pay by credit card. See which
balances need follow-up, automate routine
reminders and keep families informed
through the mobile app.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:32.855
How does StarSI compare with hiring?

00:00:33.005 --> 00:00:41.205
Think about the value of an office manager
at $5,000 and a professional marketer and
business advisor at another $5,000.

00:00:41.355 --> 00:00:46.590
These are illustrative comparisons. Actual
staffing costs and savings vary.

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:49.490
What does StarSI bring together?

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:58.455
StarSI helps you handle the office work,
follow up with prospects and use school
insights to make business decisions, all
in one place.
